flowchart LR
    UI[管理端 / 会话工作台] --> API[cmd AI Handlers]
    MSG[Conversation 分配或客户新消息] --> AW[aiagent Worker]
    API --> AI[internal/ai Manager]
    AW --> AI
    AI --> CP[Completion Provider]
    AI --> EP[Embedding Provider]
    AI --> IDX[内存向量索引]
    AI --> HT[自定义 HTTP Tool]
    AW --> CONV[Conversation Manager]
    AW --> OTP[Redis OTP 状态]
    AW --> NOTIFY[Email Notification]
    IDX <--> DB[(PostgreSQL embeddings)]
